      "title": "Scope",
      "content": "Scope: This Indian Standard (IS 694 : 2010) covers and specifies requirements for Polyvinyl Chloride Insulated Cables for Working Voltages up to and Including 1100 V (Fourth Revision). It applies to pvc_insulated_cables under cables_conductors category in the electrical domain.",
